(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: DRV2605L closed-loop LRA driver with auto-resonance (BRD-058, should) for the\n   Vybronics VG1040003D coin LRA on the case; mainline drv260x (DKMS on Debian).\n2. Absent state: EN low: standby; unfitted: 0x5A free, LRA contacts open.\n3. IN/TRIG to GND (effects over I2C, SLOS854D p. 5); VDD/NC tied to VDD.\n4. VDD from vcc3v3_sys through link #19, 0.1 Ω (power tree §4.12: 0.1 A est., 10 mV)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 144.78 0) (size 129.54 16.51) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea3079f0-3c51-5959-8592-e9ee36a06bc9"))
